    "notes": "Boundary is a reviewed interpretation of the eight RIDEM parcels clustered around the Beach Pond access and POTA coordinate within Arcadia. The selection follows the parcel group associated with 6163-6174 Beach Pond Quitclaim Deed.pdf but includes only DEM_ID 6163, 6166-6170, and 6173-6174 (406.84 GIS acres); DEM_ID 6164, 6165, 6171, and 6172 are excluded. The official Beach Pond access point is inside DEM_ID 6173, while the approximate POTA coordinate is about 3.3 meters outside the selected union."
